    <!-- Zhadsnark da Rippa (p130) - 190 pts -->
    <selectionEntry id="orks-dp05-0000-0001" name="Zhadsnark da Rippa" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="orks-dp05-0000-cl01" name="HQ:" hidden="false" targetId="4f85-eb33-30c9-8f51" primary="true"/>
        <categoryLink id="orks-dp05-0000-cl02" name="Unit:" hidden="false" targetId="36c3-e85e-97cc-c503" primary="false"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule id="orks-dp05-0000-r001" name="Warlord Trait: Ridin&apos; Into da Evil Sunset" page="130" hidden="false">
          <description>If Zhadsnark is an army&apos;s Warlord, he must have the following Warlord Trait:
Ridin&apos; Into da Evil Sunset: Zhadsnark is counted as a Speedboss for the purpose of any Waaagh! Army which requires a Speedboss. If Zhadsnark is an army&apos;s Warlord, all units comprised entirely of models with the Cavalry Unit Type that have the Da Kolours (Red Wunz Go Faster) special rule gain the Scouts special rule. In addition, an army with Zhadsnark as its Warlord gains an additional Reaction in the opposing player&apos;s Movement phase as long as he has not been removed as a casualty.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="orks-dp05-0000-r002" name="Zhadsnark&apos;s Da Rippa" page="130" hidden="false">
          <description>Zhadsnark&apos;s Da Rippa is counted as a &apos;power&apos; weapon for those rules that affect such weapons.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="orks-dp05-0000-r003" name="Da Beast" page="130" hidden="false">
          <description>Da Beast is equipped with a Dakkagun and a Skorcha. If Zhadsnark chooses to Run, he gains the Shrouded (4+) special rule until the start of the controlling player&apos;s next turn and, if he is the only model in his unit, he may choose to add triple his Initiative value to his Movement characteristic when making that Run move.
Additionally, whenever Zhadsnark makes his Hammer of Wrath attacks, the controlling player may choose to reduce the value of his Hammer of Wrath (X) special rule to 1. If that player does so, that single Hit is inflicted at Strength 10, AP2.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="orks-dp05-0000-il01" name="Da Kolours (X)" hidden="false" targetId="orks-rule-kolo-0001" type="rule"/>
        <infoLink id="orks-dp05-0000-il02" name="Red Wunz Go Faster" hidden="false" targetId="orks-rule-kolo-red0" type="rule"/>
        <infoLink id="orks-dp05-0000-il03" name="Independent Character" hidden="false" targetId="c57d-4820-458a-7ab5" type="rule"/>
