    <!-- Zodgrod Wortsnagga (p133) - 170 pts -->
    <selectionEntry id="orks-dp08-0000-0001" name="Zodgrod Wortsnagga" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="orks-dp08-0000-cl01" name="HQ:" hidden="false" targetId="4f85-eb33-30c9-8f51" primary="true"/>
        <categoryLink id="orks-dp08-0000-cl02" name="Unit:" hidden="false" targetId="36c3-e85e-97cc-c503" primary="false"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule id="orks-dp08-0000-r001" name="Super Runts" page="133" hidden="false">
          <description>Zodgrod may not be an army&apos;s Warlord. When building an army list, Zodgrod&apos;s controlling player can select one unit of Gretchin in their army to be Zodgrod&apos;s Super Runts. Zodgrod must join that unit before the start of battle and may not willingly leave that unit unless all models in that unit are removed as casualties.
Apply the following changes to a Super Runts unit:
- The unit may not include Runtherds or be joined by Characters other than Zodgrod.
- The unit&apos;s Weapon Skill characteristic is changed to 3, its Ballistic Skill characteristic to 4, and its Leadership characteristic to 7.
- All Gretchin in the unit gain the Line Unit sub-Type.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="orks-dp08-0000-r002" name="Beast Gob" page="133" hidden="false">
          <description>If Zodgrod is included in an army, add 1 to To Hit rolls for attacks made using Attack Squigs, Squighogs, Smasha Squigs and Squigosaurs by models in the controlling player&apos;s army so long as Zodgrod has not been removed as a casualty.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
